# ==============================================================================
# Verity AI — Environment Configuration Template
# ==============================================================================
# NOTE: Verity AI is a client-side Chrome Extension.
# API keys are configured directly in the Extension Settings UI (gear icon)
# and securely stored in your local browser sandbox (chrome.storage.local).
#
# NEVER commit your actual API keys to version control!
#
# Optional reference variables for automated testing or headless scripts:
GROQ_API_KEY=gsk_your_groq_api_key_here
SERPAPI_KEY=your_serpapi_key_here
